The terms above cover the original code and documentation in this repository
ONLY. The following are not the author's to license, and their own terms
govern them — those terms override everything above for the files named:

  three.js — docs/vendor/three/
      MIT Licence, © 2010-2024 three.js authors. The licence notice is
      retained in the distributed file.

  OpenStreetMap-derived data — building outlines, paths, plazas, names and the
  campus boundary, in docs/data/campus-3d.json, docs/data/campus-boundary.json
  and docs/data/region-osm.json
      © OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database Licence (ODbL) v1.0.
      https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
      These are derivative databases. Anyone redistributing them must do so
      under ODbL, and that obligation runs with the files regardless of the
      terms above.

  USGS 3DEP aerial LiDAR (CA_SanDiegoQL2_2014) — heights, terrain, trees
      Public domain (work of the U.S. Government).

  USDA NAIP aerial imagery — the aerial colour base and minimap
      Public domain (work of the U.S. Government).

  UC San Diego facilities GIS — per-mass building geometry
      Property of the University of California, San Diego, used here for
      non-commercial academic work.

  Satellite imagery — Imagery © Google (Map Tiles API) and, where selected,
  Imagery © Apple (Maps Web Snapshot)
      Governed by the Google Maps Platform Terms of Service and the Apple
      MapKit JS terms respectively. NOT licensed for redistribution by this
      repository or by anyone who obtains it from this repository. Imagery is
      used at build time as a measurement source; the derived measurements —
      not the pixels — are what this project publishes.

